    "reviews": "\u201cEnjoyed it even though it is short. Simple and straight to the point. Very fair price for the amount of content.\u201d<br>Steam<br><br>\u201cThe Lewd Deal is a short and sweet game. While some players found it too short, I thought it was fine for the asking price (and worth getting on sale). The renders are excellent and even though it is a short game, it was still well done and I enjoyed it for what it was, a simple yet complete slice-of-life story. I would look forward to a sequel.\u201d<br>Steam<br><br>\u201cI like the game. yes it is short, but some times I want to relax with an AVN and don't have the the time for a long story line. The single route is listed as the &quot;vanilla&quot; route - I actually found it the more interesting route to go. Overall, very short but excellent game.\u201d<br>Steam<br>",
